 this method will be called. I think we should re-enable a11y in the same place that we clean up…"],["ef52fecc_d57f943c",26,0,1,"leave? keep?"],["fb20c062_5414d91c",26,0,1,"this is `self.baseViewController`, right? I would maybe use that to make sure it's very clear that we're disabling a11y on the parent."]],0,101],[7132142,20403,17,0.622,0.461,[[0,92]],[],0,102],[7139560,20404,15,0.437,0.306,[[0,93]],[["12e61df6_4941bf04",26,-1,0,"Is `self.currentPageViewController.presentingViewController` still correct if you open up an old customization sub-menu (e.g. cards or discover feed) and then dismiss by tapping on the dim view? I…"],["311a91ba_9fb25b86",26,-1,1,"Can we remove these lines now that we're doing it at a higher level?"],["e43ea250_86ac8369",26,-1,1,"nit: I feel a bit weird about calling out `TabGridViewController` here in the comment, as it's not necessarily clear that the presenting view controller is guaranteed to be that. But I'm not sure…"]],0,103],[7147687,20406,58,1.112,0.852,[[4,0.619,2,36],[5,0.381,1,22]],[["5ec779d2_490793eb",51,-2,1,"This can be one initial slash"],["0a4f0630_df6adf28",52,-1,1,"Can you add \"Dialog\" or \"Sheet\" at the end, so that we don't confuse this for a system alert? It seems obvious now but in 1 year when we're browsing the list of metric names in the UMA dashboard…"],["350ea80b_20c5c67d",3,-1,1,"Buf -> Bug"],["4caf1478_2eba5c2f",51,-1,1,"Same here about the \"alert\", maybe \"ConfirmationAlertSheetAction\" or something"],["5da0aca6_a4ffd631",51,-1,1,"I think these are long enough to get truncated in some charts on the UMA dashboard, it's not a big deal but I would remove \"Action\" here to just say e.g. \"Primary button\" \"Dismiss button\" etc, just…"],["98db718c_52433481",52,-1,1,"Same here"],["ace1fa14_0413d0d1",53,-1,1,"I'd name these as close as possible to their enums.xml counterparts, so if you followed my other comment, these would be \"kPrimaryButtonTapped\", \"kDismissButtonTapped\" etc"]],0,104],[7152400,20406,43,1.101,0.895,[[5,0.511,2,22],[4,0.489,3,21]],[["3e47312c_400e067f",42,-1,0,"Sorry if this was in the other CL too, but why only fire the event if the delegate responds to the selector? I guess most likely it won't matter (that'd be a bug, i assume if the delegate doesn't…"]],0,105],[7161575,20409,7,0.28,0.2,[[0,94]],[],0,106],[7155875,20419,3,0.142,0.092,[[0,95]],[],0,107],[7209834,20420,54,1.112,0.852,[[0,96]],[["324272c0_64638b92",54,0,1,"`subviews.firstObject` is quite brittle, can we use a better identifier?"]],0,108],[7226581,20426,20,0.622,0.461,[[0,97]],[],0,109],[7224833,20426,75,2.078,1.66,[[0,98]],[["1d01ac36_6decb7a4",55,0,1,"Looks like we don't need these imports? Please remove them and see if any others are unrelated"]],0,110],[7229562,20426,67,2.078,1.66,[[0,99]],[["22bb3ee7_a454ca14",3,0,0,"What about the field trial testing config entry? We must have an entry there right? We should remove it"],["4b538e55_512c4061",1,0,1,"Can we remove this whole method now?"]],0,111],[7228811,20427,2,0.142,0.088,[[3,8]],[],0,112],[7229083,20427,140,4.026,3.231,[[0,0.886,100,124],[3,0.114,9,16]],[["1ef776a3_1d2d5aac",56,0,1,"Do we still need this check? Previously this would always evaluate to true since `IsSignInButtonNoAvatarEnabled` was launched, but now it'll only execute `if (colorPalette)`"]],0,113],[7232330,20427,47,1.112,0.852,[[0,0.833,101,39],[3,0.167,10,8]],[],0,114],[7252589,20433,4,0.156,0.113,[[5,3]],[],0,115],[7271387,20441,14,0.437,0.306,[[0,103]],[],0,117],[7276531,20441,929,9.221,7.387,[[0,105]],[],0,119]]}